{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"nav","type":"text","text":"# 能力仲裁｜流程子图\n请求定位Spec→原生TryActivateAbility→final Can评估→组预留/终检；真实Queued失败→ASC输入缓冲有限等待→组空或回场待定解除后交下一次Process重试。\n[[GGYGO_结构_AbilitySystem.canvas|结构图]] · [[AbilitySystem/结构|接口]] · [[GGYGO_流程_原请求终止.canvas|激活与结束]]","x":0,"y":0,"width":1660,"height":150,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"request","type":"text","text":"1. InputTag / ActionTag定位Spec。\n玩家输入由ASC输入缓冲在ProcessAbilityInput内、以本次输入尝试为来源调用原生TryActivateAbility；OnSpawn与Boss BT也直接调用原生Try。\nBoss CanActivateAbilityByHandle为QueryOnly预检，无玩家retry来源；真Try仍完整准入。","x":0,"y":351,"width":390,"height":330,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"tag","type":"text","text":"2. final GA::CanActivateAbility。\n要求项目ASC与有效Spec；InstancedPerActor已激活即拒→Super原GAS/BP/成本/冷却/Tag/Mapping检查→State.SwitchReturnPending期间拒输入发起的激活→组规则→CanActivateAbilityAdditional追加业务条件。\n失败Tag区分可重试（ActivationGroupQueued／SwitchReturnPending）与不可重试。","x":470,"y":351,"width":390,"height":330,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"group","type":"text","text":"3. ASC按原组规则仲裁（IsActivationBlockedByGroup）。\nSingleInstance核旧实例可取消性、优先级/平手；Queued只拒占用，Coexist保持。\n只读权威组登记；不复制GAS Active，不建立自动激活队列。","x":940,"y":351,"width":410,"height":330,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"allow","type":"text","text":"4A. 原生PreActivate→ASC NotifyAbilityActivated：输入缓冲认领本次输入尝试；GA签发激活身份；ASC分配准入序号并登记组预留。\nActiveCount++后final Activate：Initialize原激活资源→FinalizeAbilityGroupAdmission终检→相机/offset→Body；每次外调返回后核原激活仍有效。\n较新pending拒较旧，settled冲突按原取消；终检只看权威组登记。","x":1430,"y":216,"width":410,"height":420,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"reject","type":"text","text":"4B. final NotifyAbilityFailed。\n先复制失败Tags；本次输入尝试的失败带ActivationGroupQueued或SwitchReturnPending时，输入缓冲为原请求登记等待顺序与Spec重试许可，再Super原失败反馈。\n返栈后重核原来源才发OnAbilityInputRetryable观察；Hero不保存等待，嵌套Try不借本次输入来源。","x":1430,"y":675,"width":410,"height":350,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"freed","type":"text","text":"5. 原实例结束→ASC NotifyAbilityEnded。\n先退役激活身份、摘组登记→Super减ActiveCount/广播→返栈组仍空才BroadcastAbilityGroupFreedIfEmpty。\n输入缓冲先取整批等待并清零，按首次Queued顺序QueueAbilityInputRetry；拒绝候选也已消费。\n再OnAbilityGroupFreed观察；下一次ProcessAbilityInput才Try。\nSwitchReturnPending登记的等待在标签移除后的Process走同一唤醒；仅新的Queued失败再入尾。","x":940,"y":824,"width":410,"height":350,"color":"4"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"e1","fromNode":"request","fromSide":"right","toNode":"tag","toSide":"left","label":"Spec请求→原生TryActivateAbility / QueryOnly预检"},
		{"id":"e2","fromNode":"tag","fromSide":"right","toNode":"group","toSide":"left","label":"原GAS/Tag检查通过→唯一组规则"},
		{"id":"e3","fromNode":"group","fromSide":"right","toNode":"allow","toSide":"left","label":"Can通过→实际Notify身份/预留→ActiveCount++后的终检"},
		{"id":"e4","fromNode":"group","fromSide":"right","toNode":"reject","toSide":"left","label":"真实阻断/占组→本次失败来源"},
		{"id":"e5","fromNode":"reject","fromSide":"right","toNode":"freed","toSide":"left","label":"真实Queued在ASC登记等待；只等占位真实结束"},
		{"id":"e6","fromNode":"freed","fromSide":"left","toNode":"request","toSide":"bottom","label":"整批等待先消费→合法原Retry进入Pending→下一唯一Process"},
		{"id":"e7-original-active-end-group-freed","fromNode":"allow","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"freed","toSide":"top","label":"原激活结束进入ASC NotifyAbilityEnded"}
	]
}
